error[B0420]: the hook `useAccountOf` is called outside a view member
 --> check/hooks_conditional.bloom:6:23
  |
6 |   let picked = true ? useAccountOf("a") : useAccountOf("b")
  |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^ a hook runs on every render, in the same order
  |
help: call it as a view member (`let value = useAccountOf(…)`), or at the top level of a hook function (`fn useX`)
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#73-reactivity-compile-time

